      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Mac Logs — Quick Guide\nThis dashboard shows **system**, **app**, and **observability** logs in one place.\n\n**Best starting point**\n- Time range: **Last 1 hour**\n- job: **system**\n- log_type: **system** or **wifi**\n\n**Common searches**\n- `error`, `failed`, `panic`, `crash`\n- App names (e.g., `Chrome`, `Docker`, `Zoom`)\n\n**What each filter means**\n- **job**: system vs user vs observability\n- **log_type**: category like wifi/install/diagnostics/app\n- **filename**: exact file you want to tail\n- **search**: keyword in the log message\n\nTip: Expand a log row to see full metadata and the file path."
